module Core

### Represents the crashable raised for functionality that has been declared but
### not implemented yet.
crashable NotImplementedError
  ### Stores the name or description of the missing feature.
  feature: Text

### Returns the default message for unimplemented functionality.
### :returns: The resulting `Text` value.
routine NotImplementedError.crash_message() -> Text
  return f"Not implemented: {me.feature}"
